SUBJECT: Decision needed by {date}: {one-line ask}

RECOMMENDATION (BLUF)
We recommend {option B}: {impact in business terms}.
We need {budget / people / approval} by {date}.

WHY NOW
{cost of waiting, in money, risk or customers}

OPTIONS              Cost (range)    Time      Main risk
A. Do nothing        $0 now          -         {what keeps getting worse}
B. {recommended}     {$low-$high}    {weeks}   {risk + mitigation}
C. {alternative}     {$low-$high}    {weeks}   {risk + mitigation}

AI QUALITY, IN PLAIN WORDS
- On {N} real cases it was wrong about {1 in X} times (today's process: {1 in Y}).
- When it is wrong: {what the customer sees, what it costs}.
- Safeguards: {human review, guardrails, confidence threshold}.
- Residual risk we accept: {what can still happen, how we'd notice}.
- Rollback: {owner} can switch it off in {minutes}.

WHAT WOULD CHANGE THIS RECOMMENDATION
{signal: vendor price, eval regression, legal ruling}
